    "WHO 血糖参考：空腹 6.1 / 7.0，餐后两小时 7.8 / 11.1 mmol/L；其他时段不分级。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHO 血糖参考：空腹 6.1 / 7.0，餐后两小时 7.8 / 11.1 mmol/L；其他时段不分级。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHO glucose reference: fasting 6.1 / 7.0, two hours after meals 7.8 / 11.1 mmol/L. Other times are not graded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHO 血糖參考：空腹 6.1 / 7.0，餐后兩小時 7.8 / 11.1 mmol/L；其他時段不分級。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次购买，不自动续费。试用期已有家人与提醒到期后继续可用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次购买，不自动续费。试用期已有家人与提醒到期后继续可用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One purchase, no automatic renewal. Family profiles and reminders created during the trial remain available afterward."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次購買，不自動續費。試用期已有家人與提醒到期后繼續可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
