    "健康未授权或同步失败。去 设置 > 健康 > 数据访问 打开；本地记录不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "健康未授权或同步失败。去 设置 > 健康 > 数据访问 打开；本地记录不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Health access is unavailable or sync failed. Open Settings > Health > Data Access to allow access. Your local records still work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
