    "这 30 天您记了 %@ 次血压。买断后可用 PDF 报表、长期趋势、小组件、新增家人和提醒。记录本身永远免费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这 30 天您记了 %@ 次血压。买断后可用 PDF 报表、长期趋势、小组件、新增家人和提醒。记录本身永远免费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You recorded blood pressure %@ times in these 30 days. A one-time purchase unlocks PDF reports, long-term trends, widgets, and new family profiles and reminders. Recording stays free forever."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這 30 天您記了 %@ 次血壓。買斷后可用 PDF 報表、長期趨勢、小組件、新增家人和提醒。記錄本身永遠免費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个数对吗？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
